<title>USA: PSE to list five options on March 12.</title>
<headline>PSE to list five options on March 12.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said Friday it would begin trading five options on Wednesday, March 12.</p>
<p>The options would include D.R. Horton Inc, DeVry Inc, Equity Residential Properties Trust, Key Production Co Inc and Texas Industries Inc.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols and the options' strike prices, expiration months, position limits and pit representative or market maker.  </p>
<p>Ticker   Strikes	Months     Limits   Pit Rep/Market Maker</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------   10, 12-1/2,  Apr, May,  4,500    Guy Leung/Arvin Fong</p>
<p>	   15	     Aug, Nov</p>
<p>   17-1/2, 20,  Apr, May,  4,500    Clifford Wagener</p>
<p>	   22-1/2	 Aug, Nov</p>
<p>  40, 45, 50   Apr, May,  4,500    David Post/</p>
<p>			    Jul, Oct		Jon Donahue</p>
<p>   7-1/2, 10,   Apr, May,  4,500    Debbie Green/</p>
<p>	   12-1/2	 Jun, Sep		Alan Suslow</p>
<p>  25, 30, 35   Apr, May,  4,500    David Post/</p>
<p>			    Jul, Oct		Jon Donahue</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
